# Add Colors and make order by color functional. All items will have one of these:
"No color", "Black", "Red", "Green", "Blue", "Purple", "Yellow", "Orange", "Cyan", "White", "Gray"
And when order by color is selected, we will order everything alphabeticly or last edit time but color by color.
For example I have Red (A, V), Blue (B, Z), Yellow (C, T)
When I order by color this will happen: A > V > B > Z > C > T even though C is alphabeticly before V. 
And in the settings screen I will have the option: 
When ordered by color: order alphabeticly or order by last edit time
And I will also have a place where I can click and drag colors, that order will be used to order by color.
For example you can do red first then orange then blue... or blue, black, red... 

